==={{SSBU|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
[[File:SSBU Ancient Helm Icon.png|right|150px]]
The Ancient Helm appears as a [[Mii Headgear]], wearable by [[Mii Brawler]]s, [[Mii Gunner]]s and [[Mii Swordfighter]]s, in version 7.0.0 of {{SSBU}}. It is an exclusive bonus received alongside the [[Ancient Set|Ancient Soldier Gear]] as part of the [[Fighters Pass Vol. 2]], released on January 28, 2020.
{{Noncanon|End}}

